---
layout: notes-base.njk
permalink: /blog/index.html
title: Notes
summary: Notes from L. J. Llamas on civil engineering, document control, project coordination, and construction systems.
---
<section class="page-hero site-width"><p class="eyebrow reveal is-visible">Notes · Practice in progress</p><div class="page-hero-grid"><h1 class="reveal is-visible">Lessons from the <span>working side.</span></h1><p class="page-lead reveal is-visible" data-delay="1">Observations on project controls, document management, coordination workflows, and the small decisions that improve site delivery.</p></div></section>
<section class="page-content site-width" aria-labelledby="notes-heading"><div class="content-grid">
  <aside class="content-aside reveal"><span class="content-aside-label">01 / {% if collections.notes.length %}Published notes{% else %}Editorial plan{% endif %}</span><h2 id="notes-heading">{% if collections.notes.length %}From working practice{% else %}What I’ll write about{% endif %}</h2><p>No filler posts. Notes are developed from real practice and published when they are useful.</p></aside>
  <div class="notes-grid">
  {% for note in collections.notes %}
    <article class="note-card reveal">
      <span class="card-type">{{ note.data.category }}</span>
      <h2><a href="{{ note.url }}">{{ note.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ note.data.summary }}</p>
      <p class="note-meta"><time datetime="{{ note.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ note.data.date | readableDate }}</time> · {{ note.templateContent | readingTime }} min read</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ note.url }}" aria-label="Read {{ note.data.title }}">Read note <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if not collections.notes.length %}{% include "editorial-plan.njk" %}{% endif %}
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="contact-cta site-width reveal"><p>Related practice</p><h2>Explore the work behind the writing.</h2><a class="button button-primary" href="/artifacts.html">View artifacts <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>

